From: yinjiayi <yinjiayi@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Honor standard relative GNUInstallDirs for exported config
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 03:58:00 +0800
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [distribution multilib install paths]
SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later

Only move the exported CMake package alongside the original multilib archives.
Do not alter library sources, features, original example archives or tests.
--- a/cmake/package/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/cmake/package/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 install(
   EXPORT claw
-  DESTINATION lib/cmake/claw/
+  DESTINATION ${CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR}/cmake/claw/
   FILE claw-config-generated.cmake
   )
@@ -21,3 +21,3 @@
     ${CMAKE_CURRENT_BINARY_DIR}/claw-config-version.cmake
-  DESTINATION lib/cmake/claw/
+  DESTINATION ${CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR}/cmake/claw/
   )
